                        "username": "souvik1914581"
                    },
                    "message": "Why is the error handling flow being changed in this API? Earlier, we used to log message and return. With this change, this API is throwing.\nThe API which will catch this exception, will again log another message."
                },
                {
                    "file": "vpd-manager/src/backup_restore.cpp",
                    "line": 196,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Anupama B R",
                        "email": "anupama.b.r1@ibm.com",
                        "username": "branupama"
                    },
                    "message": "this API can throw exception, so added throw from this API so that caller API can log a PEL if required later (which has exception handling), instead of silently logging and returning.\n\nwith this flow only once message is logged."
                },
